<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Blinding Flash</ansi> mutation

Cells in your skin can discharge stored energy in a brilliant flash
of light. The mutation has damaged your own light-sensitive cells,
leaving your vision permanently diminished.

<ansi fg="yellow">Requires:</ansi>  Skin (light-emitting cells)
<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Active Ability
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Very Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Active ability: discharge a blinding burst of light at nearby foes

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Moderately reduced perception — your own vision is permanently
  impaired by the same energy that powers the flash

<ansi fg="yellow">Conflicts:</ansi> Camo Skin

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
